From 6945000d3b027787b92c7728a24a7cf9556cba40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <agent@local>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 04:51:14 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add warehouse management (multi-location stock,
 transfers)

- New tables: warehouses, warehouse_stock, stock_transfers
- inventory_movements gains an optional warehouse_id
- Transfers auto-numbered (TR-YYYY-####) and trigger-applied:
  validates source stock, moves warehouse_stock, logs a matching
  in/out inventory_movements pair. products.stock_quantity (the
  storefront total) is untouched by transfers - only relocated.
- Seeds a default 'Main Warehouse' and backfills warehouse_stock
  from existing products.stock_quantity so it's useful immediately.
- New admin page /admin/warehouses: Warehouses CRUD, Stock by
  Location (set exact per-warehouse quantity), Transfers (move +
  history). Wired into AdminLayout nav and App.tsx routes.
- useWarehouses/useWarehouseStock/useStockTransfers hooks added
  following the existing useSuppliers/usePurchaseOrders pattern.
